oon","name":"Phantoon Behavior","description":"Deep-dive editor for Phantoon's AI timers, movement speed, flame rain, and wavy effect parameters.","enabled":false,"writes":[],"configType":"phantoon","configValue":null,"configData":null,"customItems":[]},{"id":"config_enemy_stats","name":"Enemy Stats Override","description":"Override HP and contact damage for common enemies.","enabled":false,"writes":[],"configType":"enemy_stats","configValue":null,"configData":null,"customItems":[]},{"id":"config_enemy_drops","name":"Enemy Drop Rates","description":"Override item drop probabilities (small/large energy, missile, super, PB) for each enemy.","enabled":false,"writes":[],"configType":"enemy_drops","configValue":null,"configData":null,"customItems":[]},{"id":"config_enemy_vuln","name":"Enemy Vulnerabilities","description":"Override per-weapon damage multipliers for each enemy. 0=immune, 2=normal, 4=double.","enabled":false,"writes":[],"configType":"enemy_vuln","configValue":null,"configData":null,"customItems":[]},{"id":"config_samus_physics","name":"Samus Physics","description":"Override Samus movement physics — jump heights, gravity, run speed, air control, and more.","enabled":false,"writes":[],"configType":"samus_physics","configValue":null,"configData":null,"customItems":[]},{"id":"config_boss_defeated","name":"Boss Defeated Flags","description":"Mark bosses as already defeated. Rooms load in post-boss state and Tourian unlocks when all four main bosses are defeated.","enabled":false,"writes":[],"configType":"boss_defeated","configValue":null,"configData":null,"customItems":[]},{"id":"config_controller","name":"Controller Configuration","description":"Remap the default button assignments for Shot, Jump, Dash, Item Select/Cancel, and Aim.","enabled":false,"writes":[],"configType":"controller_config","configValue":null,"configData":null,"customItems":[]},{"id":"hex_instant_respawn","name":"Instant Respawn on Death","description":"Skip Game Over screen — reload last sav